  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Capabilities of the Palestinian Authority&apos; Government Communication Centre (GCC).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BCGJ will provide technical assistance to improve the PA&apos; government communication capabilities and transparency in line their national development and reform agenda. The technical assistance will be delivered through the UK Government Communications Service International (GCSI) after delivering a comprehensive assessment report in March 2025. The support is for one year 2025-26.</narrative>
  </description>
